block":"b-3288b48dae3a5640a329","layer":"original","quote":"谢景者，字叔发。南阳宛人。在郡有治迹〖2〗，吏民称之；以为前有顾邵〖3〗，其次即景。数年，卒官。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-ae3113228c84008d2e2a","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-363abea6e3d6e37e3cfd","layer":"original","quote":"谢景时为豫章太守，不胜哀情〖26〗；弃官奔赴〖27〗，拜表自劾〖28〗。权曰：“君与太子从事，异于他吏。”使中使慰劳，听复本职，发遣还郡。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e7c668f34b2cb03e8c27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞陆机为谭传曰：“宣太子正位东宫，天子方隆训导之义；妙简俊彦，讲学左右。时四方之杰毕集，太傅诸葛恪等，雄奇盖众；而谭以清识绝伦，独见推重。自太尉范慎、谢景、（羊徽）〔羊衟〕之徒，皆以秀称；其名而悉在谭下。”","attribution":"裴注·陆机《顾谭传》","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6e97af01b0f6928da4e6","start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-f635ed253b683668cd1f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-bf1b366934d654120c2c","layer":"original","quote":"拔彭城蔡款、南阳谢景于孤微童幼。后并为国士","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
